<title>USA: Key Energy names Stephen McGregor CFO.</title>
<headline>Key Energy names Stephen McGregor CFO.</headline>
<dateline>EAST BRUNSWICK, N.J. 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Key Energy Group Inc said Wednesday that it has named Stephen McGregor as its chief financial officer.</p>
<p>McGregor, the company said, was most recently a senior advisor on energy matters for BT Wolfensohn, a division of Bankers Trust.</p>
<p>Key Energy told Reuters that McGregor will take over the duties of his office from Francis John, who retains the titles of chairman and chief executive officer.</p>
</text>
